cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "conformalband: a coverage audit for conformal prediction intervals under declared covariate shift"
abstract: >-
  Split, Mondrian and weighted conformal prediction intervals for a synthetic
  aerospace regression, with empirical coverage and interval width measured
  against the nominal level and against the finite-sample coverage bound, in
  distribution and under three declared covariate shifts of increasing
  severity. Includes the measured point at which weighted conformal loses its
  guarantee when the declared likelihood-ratio weights are wrong. The
  parametric Gaussian baseline and the analytic physics regressor are
  implemented first and reported honestly where they win. Research-grade; not
  flight-qualified, not certified, not approved for operational aerospace use.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-10"
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
